    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "Services"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Landscape Construction"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Our experienced team of landscape designers and horticulturists are dedicated to bringing your vision to life. With a passion for creativity and detail, we ensure every project is a masterpiece."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Outdoor Living Areas"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Add info change pic"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Pools"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Add info change pic"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Turf & Putting Greens"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Add info change pic"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Hardscapes"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Our team is experienced in the design and implementation of almost any exterior feature including patios, pavers, walkways, water features, driveways, outdoor kitchens, and more!"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Retaining Walls"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Add info change pic"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Landscape Lighting"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Welcome your guests and yourself while adding elegance, value and safety with proper outdoor lighting that accentuates your efforts, shows off your curb appeal and helps keep your family safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Drainage & Grade Work"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Thoughtful grading and drainage is essential to reshape and properly drain the landscape, steer water away from structures and to prevent flooding."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Irrigation & Water Features"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Most irrigation systems are “in ground” so that everything is buried and out of sight. Pipes, sprinklers, and irrigation valves are hidden, so you have a cleaner, more natural landscape."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Design Services"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Ready to change your landscape but unsure where to start? Register for a free consultation to ask questions and develop a plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Please contact us if you cannot find an answer to your question."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Our team members have extensive experience and horticultural backgrounds, and we will be familiar with your unique landscape needs."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We have the necessary licenses and insurance for all of our projects. Larger construction projects require special licenses and certifications, and we have trusted partners that we work with for those special cases."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We can do almost any kind of landscaping, but our specialty is in mixing non-native and native plants to make a landscape that meets your needs and fits the unique ecology of Louisiana."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Follow us"
    },
    {
